                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra.</hi>
                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d414-f2" n="2" xml:id="d414-f2-content">
                <p>Dated June 1, <ref target="#pg820">p. 820</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d414-f3" n="3" xml:id="d414-f3-content">
                <p>June 6, <ref target="#pg828">p. 828</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d414-f4" n="4" xml:id="d414-f4-content">
                <p>In Actel 62, June 12, from Paris, not printed,
                    Secretary Acheson confirmed his approval
                    of NSC 24/2, but stated that Webb’s proposed additional sentence would be
                    desirable. (740.00119 Control (Germany)/6–1249)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
